      "message": "This is moderately expensive, involving creating a copy of mAccessUids. NetworkCapabilities#equals is probably called quite frequently. Can we do better? Perhaps by using a better structure such as a sorted set? Or by making the access UIDs only a set of UIDs, not a set of UID ranges?",
