      "lineNbr": 6361,
      "author": {
        "id": 1015428
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-01-07T14:40:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, though the intent of this line is less to fix the bug than to disallow access UIDs in this method.\n\nSpecifically, before this patch it was possible to file a network request for an NC with broken private DNS with an intent. Assuming you managed to build such a request, which you can\u0027t really do.\n\nI can split this into a preliminary patch if you prefer that ; I didn\u0027t think it mattered too much considering the new check is 99.99% of the point here.",
      "parentUuid": "a9e36850_a6bdc3b2",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 6361,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 6361,
        "endChar": 41
